[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11341.11, "timestamp": "03:09:01", "text": "我的天啊。这就是他们所谓的觉醒吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11343.99, "timestamp": "03:09:03", "text": "人还是什么东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11346.87, "timestamp": "03:09:06", "text": "嗯，我想也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11349.269, "timestamp": "03:09:09", "text": "我不喜欢给别人贴标签，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11351.59, "timestamp": "03:09:11", "text": "就像个小玩意儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11355.11, "timestamp": "03:09:15", "text": "M，这就像给每个人都打电话一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11357.99, "timestamp": "03:09:17", "text": "例如，DEI是人们常说的新概念。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.59, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11361.269, "timestamp": "03:09:21", "text": "如果有什么不好的事情发生，或者像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11363.59, "timestamp": "03:09:23", "text": "游戏中的多样性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11367.83, "timestamp": "03:09:27", "text": "哦，那件事的发生是因为像DEI（多元化、公平和包容）这样的因素。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11375.03, "timestamp": "03:09:35", "text": "这是关于包容性的事情，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11378.95, "timestamp": "03:09:38", "text": "多样性之类的。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.51, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "基本上发生的事情是，呃，那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11386.59, "timestamp": "03:09:46", "text": "他们被聘用是为了确保团队的多样性。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.51, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "因为仔细想想，每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.99, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "游戏本身就非常丰富多样。"}]